PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE INTERNAL_EXECUTION
# Serial occurrence step, IDT 00F / 05H. Input projections belong to the same NOW node.
# The edge is a supplied realized IDT occurrence; elapsed activity is not phase.
OP NOW_BEFORE SOURCE now.node
OP WINDING_BEFORE SOURCE now.winding
OP SIGN_BEFORE SOURCE now.spinor_i_sign
OP THETA_BEFORE SOURCE now.theta
OP EDGE SOURCE idt.edge_id
OP DTHETA SOURCE idt.dtheta
OP OBJECT SOURCE next.object
# Occupied Hotel is the former frontier, not a separate log.
OP HOTEL IDENTITY NOW_BEFORE
OP WINDING DIFFERENCE WINDING_BEFORE -1
OP SIGN DIFFERENCE 0 SIGN_BEFORE
OP NEG_DTHETA DIFFERENCE 0 DTHETA
OP THETA DIFFERENCE THETA_BEFORE NEG_DTHETA
OP NOW COMPOSITION HOTEL EDGE WINDING SIGN THETA OBJECT
# Serial index is a coordinate of NOW, not another history structure.
OP INDEX IDENTITY WINDING
EMIT HOTEL
EMIT NOW
EMIT INDEX
EMIT WINDING
EMIT SIGN
EMIT THETA
